e movement-based mayhem.\n\ngamemodes: \n- horror \u2013 not super scary, but huge, fun, and tense in all the right ways\n- hangout \u2013 chill on 3 small islands, perfect for messing around and talking\n- maze \u2013 get lost, split up, or race to the end\n- robbery \u2013 currently broken, coming soon ;-;\n- speeding wall \u2013 react fast or get wiped\n- glass bridge \u2013 trust your instincts\u2026 or fall\n\nfeatures:\n- gtag-style locomotion\n- multiplayer chaos with friends\n- inspired by cube runners\n- fast, replayable game modes\n- simple to learn, hard to master\n\nif you like movement-based vr games, chaotic multiplayer, and clutch moments, circle chaos delivers.\n\nrun fast.\ntrust no floor.\nembrace the chaos B)", "short_description": "circle chaos is a fast-paced vr game inspired by cube runners, built with gtag-style locomotion.\n\nswing, climb, jump, and launch yourself through multiple chaotic gamemodes with friends or solo.\n\ngamemodes:\n- horror (fun, big, not too scary)\n- hangout (3 small islands)\n- maze\n- robbery (broken for now)\n- speeding wall\n- glass bridge\n\npure movement, pure chaos B)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/circlechaosvr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "jeremy2050games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/circlechaosvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_inp